# @mnb/ui

Read `packages/ui/.instructions.md` before adding or changing a component.

- One directory per component: `MNBName.svelte`, `MNBName.type.ts`, `MIGRATION.md`, and `MNBName.enum.ts` when a prop is a closed set.
- Export `MNBName` from `src/index.ts`. Root class is `mnb-name`. No BEM.
- Tokens only, and every custom property is `--mnb-…`. No `$env`, Hygraph, Mistral, or TIDAL imports.
- `href` values are passed in already resolved. `resolve()` does not exist in this package.
